  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.390" end="00:02.450" ttm:agent="v1">Breaking news today as the Chum Bucket</p>
      <p begin="00:02.450" end="00:05.340" ttm:agent="v1">Has been riddled with bullets in a drive-by shooting</p>
      <p begin="00:05.340" end="00:08.210" ttm:agent="v1">Emergency responders have reported one female victim</p>
      <p begin="00:08.210" end="00:09.710" ttm:agent="v1">And one thing is for certain</p>
      <p begin="00:09.530" end="00:13.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Bikini Bottom is no longer safe (woo-hoo)</p>
      <p begin="00:13.760" end="00:16.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Red bottom, sippin' purple lean (woo-hoo)</p>
      <p begin="00:16.860" end="00:20.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Bitch I'm gon' ride for my fuckin' team (woo-hoo)</p>
      <p begin="00:20.160" end="00:22.200" ttm:agent="v1">Plankton whack, he a fucking fiend</p>
      <p begin="00:22.200" end="00:24.460" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I run the game, what's my name?</p>
      <p begin="00:24.460" end="00:26.600" ttm:agent="v1">Eu-Eu-Eu-Eugene</p>
      <p begin="00:26.600" end="00:29.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Ayo, boss, what I gotta do to them opps? (Hahaha)</p>
      <p begin="00:29.790" end="00:32.860" ttm:agent="v1">Shoot to kill, grab my grill, bitch, it's hot</p>
      <p begin="00:32.860" end="00:35.880" ttm:agent="v1">I got that burner to his mouth, pop rocks</p>
      <p begin="00:35.880" end="00:39.770" ttm:agent="v1">I'm blowin' bubbles at his head until they pop</p>
      <p begin="00:39.770" end="00:41.270" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Gary, where my Glock? (The stick)</p>
      <p begin="00:41.220" end="00:44.520" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Yeah, my boy a snail, but you know he keep it hot (meow)</p>
      <p begin="00:44.520" end="00:47.470" ttm:agent="v1">Did this for my city, 'cause I rep Bikini Bottom</p>
      <p begin="00:47.470" end="00:50.360" ttm:agent="v1">Like David v. Goliath, hit that one eye when I popped him</p>
      <p begin="00:50.360" end="00:53.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">'Cause I'm only doing real shit, I don't do no sad raps (no)</p>
      <p begin="00:53.840" end="00:57.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Squidward got the kill switch, strapped up like it's Baghdad (ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:57.060" end="01:00.310" ttm:agent="v1">Patrick, he was brainwashed but we got him back, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:00.310" end="01:01.810" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(SpongeBob, why do you drill?)</p>
      <p begin="01:01.560" end="01:04.580" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause my boss is Mr. Swags, huh, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:04.580" end="01:07.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Red bottom, sippin' purple lean (woo-hoo)</p>
      <p begin="01:07.660" end="01:10.950" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Bitch I'm gon' ride for my fuckin' team (woo-hoo)</p>
      <p begin="01:10.950" end="01:12.940" ttm:agent="v1">Plankton whack, he a fucking fiend</p>
      <p begin="01:12.940" end="01:15.240" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I run the game, what's my name?</p>
      <p begin="01:15.240" end="01:17.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Eu-Eu-Eu-Eugene (woo-hoo)</p>
      <p begin="01:17.300" end="01:20.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Red bottom, sippin' purple lean (woo-hoo)</p>
      <p begin="01:20.480" end="01:23.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Bitch I'm gon' ride for my fuckin' team (woo-hoo)</p>
      <p begin="01:23.840" end="01:25.890" ttm:agent="v1">Plankton whack, he a fucking fiend</p>
      <p begin="01:25.890" end="01:27.940" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I run the game, what's my name?</p>
      <p begin="01:27.940" end="01:29.440" ttm:agent="v1">Eu-Eu-Eu-Eugene</p>
      <p begin="01:28.980" end="01:32.010" ttm:agent="v1">Cut a bitch off like the Hash Slingin' Slasher</p>
      <p begin="01:32.010" end="01:35.360" ttm:agent="v1">Karen pissed off 'cause the Squid wouldn't smash her</p>
      <p begin="01:35.360" end="01:38.150" ttm:agent="v1">At the Bubble Bowl backstage like an actor</p>
      <p begin="01:38.150" end="01:42.060" ttm:agent="v1">She want my bull worm like it came from Alaska</p>
      <p begin="01:42.060" end="01:44.620" ttm:agent="v1">Hah, hah, hah, get the fuck away</p>
      <p begin="01:44.620" end="01:48.950" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I thought I told you bitch I'm smoking kelp up to my fucking face (hahaha, kelp)</p>
      <p begin="01:48.950" end="01:51.130" ttm:agent="v1">I do this shit like every fucking day</p>
      <p begin="01:51.130" end="01:54.620" ttm:agent="v1">Squiddie caught a kill streak, that chopper gunner on the way</p>
      <p begin="01:54.620" end="01:57.540" ttm:agent="v1">All I see are bodies fallin'</p>
      <p begin="01:57.540" end="02:00.000" ttm:agent="v1">And dead ops when duty's callin'</p>
      <p begin="02:00.000" end="02:03.100" ttm:agent="v1">I'm the red dot and purp lean pourin'</p>
      <p begin="02:03.100" end="02:07.310" ttm:agent="v1">The lean sippin' squid with no remorse</p>
      <p begin="02:07.310" end="02:09.820" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I am him (woo-hoo)</p>
      <p begin="02:09.820" end="02:12.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Red bottom, sippin' purple lean (woo-hoo)</p>
      <p begin="02:12.840" end="02:16.290" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Bitch I'm gon' ride for my fuckin' team (woo-hoo)</p>
      <p begin="02:16.290" end="02:18.380" ttm:agent="v1">Plankton whack, he a fucking fiend</p>
      <p begin="02:18.380" end="02:20.370" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I run the game, what's my name?</p>
      <p begin="02:20.370" end="02:22.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Eu-Eu-Eu-Eugene (woo-hoo)</p>
      <p begin="02:22.650" end="02:25.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Red bottom, sippin' purple lean (woo-hoo)</p>
      <p begin="02:25.500" end="02:28.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Bitch I'm gon' ride for my fuckin' team (woo-hoo)</p>
      <p begin="02:28.940" end="02:31.040" ttm:agent="v1">Plankton whack, he a fucking fiend</p>
      <p begin="02:31.040" end="02:32.960" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I run the game, what's my name?</p>
      <p begin="02:32.960" end="02:36.290" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Eu-Eu-Eu-Eugene (woo-hoo)</p>
